Burrata Salad Kit\">\n          <h3>Grilled Peach & Burrata Salad Kit</h3>\n          <p>Everything you need for a summer salad in one box.</p>\n          <div class=\"price\">$5.49</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"seasonal-card\">\n          <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461023058943-07fcbe16d735?auto=format&fit=crop&w=200&q=80\" alt=\"Coconut Cold Brew Concentrate\">\n          <h3>Coconut Cold Brew Concentrate</h3>\n          <p>Smooth, creamy cold brew with natural coconut flavor.</p>\n          <div class=\"price\">$6.99</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"seasonal-card\">\n          <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563114773-84221bd62bc3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=200&q=80\" alt=\"Mango Sticky Rice Spring Rolls\">\n          <h3>Mango Sticky Rice Spring Rolls</h3>\n          <p>A sweet twist on a classic, ready in minutes.</p>\n          <div class=\"price\">$3.99</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Categories -->\n  <section id=\"products\" class=\"categories\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"categories-header\">\n        <h2>Shop by Category</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"categories-grid\">\n        <div class=\"category-card\">\n          <img class=\"category-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582236378411-9f2257d0793b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80\" alt=\"Snacks & Sweets\">\n          <div class=\"category-overlay\">\n            <h3 class=\"category-name\">Snacks & Sweets</h3>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"category-card\">\n          <img class=\"category-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610832958506-aa56368176cf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80\" alt=\"Fresh Produce\">\n          <div class=\"category-overlay\">\n            <h3 class=\"category-name\">Fresh Produce</h3>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"category-card\">\n          <img class=\"category-img\" src=\"https://